  "prefLabel": "Puc 3002.01 Aggregate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 3002.01 “Aggregate” means to combine the natural gas loads of 2 or more customers or a single customer with multiple meters or multiple locations.\n\nSource. #7811, eff 12-28-02; ss by #9796-A, eff 9-25-10 (from Puc 3002.01) EXPIRED: 9-25-20\n\nNew. #14613, eff 6-5-26, EXPIRES: 6-5-36 (formerly Puc 3002.02)",
